<h2>Question and recommendation</h2>
<p>Decision <a href="/backlog/4010-decision-one-probation-system-for-any-new-system-or-ruling/">#4010</a> generalises model probation into one subject registry, scheduled watcher and review routine. Recommend <strong>subject, revision and evidence-scope isolation independent of encoding</strong>. Typed records are an illustrative representation. Models, systems and rulings may coexist with distinct evidence criteria; the planner build is the first proposed non-model subject. The existing planner rule reserves its probation exit to the operator; generalising that governance is this proposal.</p>
